<db:section xml:id="details">
<db:title>Detailed Description</db:title>
<db:para>The <db:link xlink:href="testwatcher.xml#changed">changed</db:link>() signal is emitted for <db:link xlink:href="../otherframework/othergroup.html#name">OtherGroup::name</db:link>, a <db:emphasis>very </db:emphasis>important event.</db:para>
<db:programlisting language="cpp">auto watcher = TestWatcher::create(config);</db:programlisting>
<db:note>
<db:para>Set config sources first.</db:para>
</db:note>
